1. Audio Capture & Analysis

Environment microphones (phone mic, IoT sensors, or wearable mics) capture ambient sound.

AI detects and classifies high-priority events (alarms, announcements, sirens, etc.).

2. Alert Decision Engine

Once the system identifies a critical event, it triggers alerts through two layers:

🪄 Layer 1: Bluetooth Device Alert (if connected)

If a smartwatch, smart band, or earbuds is paired via Bluetooth:

🔹 Vibration pattern — distinct for urgency:

Short pulses = information

Long + fast pulses = emergency

🔹 Optional subtle sound tone in earbuds.

🔹 Smartwatch display flashes a brief text alert or symbol (🔥, 🚨, ⚠️).

This ensures instant haptic or auditory feedback without needing to look at the main device.
